                <pb facs="0299" n="213" sameAs="frus:frus1927v01/pg213"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">500.A15/606: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chief of the American Representation on the
                        Preparatory Commission</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Wilson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Geneva</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1927-12-03T20:00:00+01:00"><hi rendition="#italic">December 3,
                                1927—8 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received December 3—10:30
                        a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>5. Fourth session Preparatory Commission closed today. Security Committee meets
                    on or about February 20th, Preparatory Commission March 15th.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Wilson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
